 against  another attack from michael after  surviving his first attempt on her life  with michael and laurie still alive and  mobile as her credit's role in halloween  kills it seems halloween ends will turn  its gaze toward this pairing  thematically it would make sense that  laurie and michael's fates are tied  together as a director and co-writer  green appears to be intent on telling a  halloween story that focuses on the  impact cycles of violence and trauma can  have on multiple generations lori and  her family are caught in a new cycle one  that echoes the events of 1978 but  what's different this time around is  that they are intent on breaking it with  karen and alison failing to do away with  michael it seems the only person left to  face to shape is laurie bringing  everything full circle as the original  final girl and her enemy prepare for one  final showdown  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite slasher movies are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  you

